                    dir_premium:            `Premium/differentiation — move up-market into integrated low-carbon building systems`,
                    dir_volume:             `Volume/scale — defend and grow the core equipment book via heat-pump capacity`,
                    dir_hedge:              `Hedge — fund a bit of all three and keep our options open`,
                    stop_lowmargin:         `Exit the lowest-margin commodity installation contracts that tie up working capital`,
