                    r3_cadence_label:       `Planning cadence to match the new strategy`,
                    r3_style_label:         `Control style you ask Boyne (a financial-control parent) to run with you`,
                    kpi_focused:            `A focused 4–6: ROIC, growth, recurring-revenue mix and two strategy-specific drivers`,
                    kpi_inflated:           `A full 12+ balanced scorecard covering every function and perspective`,
                    kpi_financial:          `Just two: ROIC and cash — keep it simple for the parent`,
                    inc_realign:            `Realign all three — retire volume/utilisation bonuses, reward the strategy's value driver across functions`,
                    inc_addgrowth:          `Add a growth bonus on top, but leave the legacy volume/margin/utilisation bonuses in place`,
                    inc_legacy:             `Leave incentives as they are — change the strategy slide, not the pay`,
                    cad_rolling:            `Rolling forecast + milestone reviews — re-plan as the strategy unfolds`,
