                    r4_defence_label:       `Board defence: is your capital pattern consistent with your stated strategy?`,
                    case_service:           `Services / recurring-revenue platform (case €22M)`,
                    case_heatpump:          `Heat-pump capacity expansion (case €34M)`,
                    case_automation:        `Plant automation — improves capital turn (case €22M)`,
                    kill_named:             `State plainly which case is deferred to fund the chosen direction — with its ROIC cost`,
                    kill_vague:             `We'll revisit the deferred items "later" without naming them`,
                    kill_wishlist:          `Nothing is killed — assume group restores the cut and fund all €78M`,
                    def_consistent:         `Yes — the money goes where the strategy goes, and I can walk the board through the ROIC bridge`,
